{"version":1,"content":"<p>緬甸軍政府周一（19日）在社交媒體發布照片，表示遭拘禁的81歲前國務資政昂山素姬收到英王查理斯三世贈送的書籍與文件。</p><p>法新社報道，這次是緬甸政府繼8月後，再次罕見地公開昂山素姬的照片，而且首次以「特別的女囚犯（special female prisoner）」形容她。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T12:04:04.142763+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":134,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T10:38:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T09:37:42.837954+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T11:57:40.684348+00:00","content_hash":"bfc260b7ccb22ae9a47af354adc04c864a3d8d8496b2852b4e8b547a893c3fde","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}